---
layout: default
title: Home
---
<div>
  <section style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 420px 1fr; align-items: start;">
    <div style="padding: 64px 32px 48px 24px;">
      <h1 style="font-family: 'Libre Baskerville', serif; font-size: 3.2rem; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.05; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 32px; letter-spacing: .02em;">
        Engineering<br>Systems<br><em style="font-family: 'Kalam', cursive; font-weight: 400; font-size: 1.1em; color: var(--mystic-purple); font-style: normal;">That Endure.</em>
      </h1>
      <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--graphite); margin-bottom: 36px;">
        Software engineering for complex systems.<br>Built with clarity. Designed to last.
      </p>
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; align-items: flex-start;">
        <a href="<%= relative_url "/writing" %>" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 14px 28px; background: var(--nightfall); color: #f7f1e8; text-decoration: none; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 600; border: 1px solid var(--aged-bronze);">View Work →</a>
        <a href="<%= relative_url "/philosophy" %>" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 14px 28px; background: transparent; color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 600; border: 1px solid var(--graphite);">About My Approach</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="position: relative; height: 100%;">
      <div style="position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to right, var(--paper) 0%, transparent 15%), linear-gradient(to left, var(--paper) 0%, transparent 10%), linear-gradient(to top, var(--paper) 0%, transparent 15%); pointer-events: none; z-index: 1;"></div>
      <img src="<%= relative_url "/images/hero_handdrawn.png" %>" alt="Architectural sketch" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; mix-blend-mode: multiply; opacity: .85;" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; background: #1a2340; color: #f7f1e8; padding: 48px; border-left: 3px solid var(--dusk-blue); border-bottom: 3px solid var(--dusk-blue);">
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 24px; padding-right: 32px; border-right: 1px solid rgba(247,241,232,.2);">
      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <img src="<%= relative_url "/images/tree-accent.png" %>" alt="" style="width: 48px; height: 48px; margin: 0 auto 12px; object-fit: contain;" />
        <h3 style="font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .12em; margin-bottom: 8px;">Clean Code</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.5; color: rgba(247,241,232,.7);">Readable, maintainable code that stands the test of time.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <img src="<%= relative_url "/images/leaf-accent.png" %>" alt="" style="width: 48px; height: 48px; margin: 0 auto 12px; object-fit: contain;" />
        <h3 style="font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .12em; margin-bottom: 8px;">Thoughtful Design</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.5; color: rgba(247,241,232,.7);">Intentional architecture that balances function and flexibility.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <img src="<%= relative_url "/images/box-accent.png" %>" alt="" style="width: 48px; height: 48px; margin: 0 auto 12px; object-fit: contain;" />
        <h3 style="font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .12em; margin-bottom: 8px;">System Thinking</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.5; color: rgba(247,241,232,.7);">Building scalable systems that adapt to complexity, not the other way around.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <img src="<%= relative_url "/images/mountain-accent.png" %>" alt="" style="width: 48px; height: 48px; margin: 0 auto 12px; object-fit: contain;" />
        <h3 style="font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .12em; margin-bottom: 8px;">Continuous Improvement</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.5; color: rgba(247,241,232,.7);">Iterating with purpose to deliver lasting value and long-term clarity.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; padding: 8px 0 8px 32px;">
      <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; color: rgba(247,241,232,.85); margin-bottom: 24px;">
        I help organizations turn complex problems into robust, elegant software. From backend systems to developer experience, I build solutions that are reliable, scalable, and a joy to work with.
      </p>
      <a href="<%= relative_url "/contact" %>" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; color: #f7f1e8; text-decoration: none;">Let's Build Something Meaningful →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="padding: 48px;">
    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; margin-bottom: 24px;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .16em; color: var(--ink); white-space: nowrap;">Latest Posts</h2>
      <span style="flex: 1; height: 2px; background: var(--dusk-blue); margin: 0 5px;"></span>
      <a href="<%= relative_url "/writing" %>" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 600; color: var(--graphite); text-decoration: none; white-space: nowrap;">View All →</a>
    </div>
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px;">
      <% collections.posts.resources.sort_by { |p| p.data.date }.reverse.first(3).each do |post| %>
        <a href="<%= post.relative_url %>" style="border: 1px solid var(--warm-stone); padding: 24px; text-decoration: none; color: inherit;">
          <span style="font-size: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .1em; color: var(--fog); font-weight: 600;"><%= post.data.date.strftime("%b %d, %Y") %></span>
          <h3 style="font-family: 'Libre Baskerville', serif; font-size: 16px; margin: 8px 0; color: var(--ink);"><%= post.data.title %></h3>
          <p style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--graphite);"><%= post.data.description&.slice(0, 100) %></p>
        </a>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
